    "guideHtml": "<div class=\"row\"><label>[Boarisch] User Guide</label><div><h5>[Boarisch] Overview</h5><ul><li>[Boarisch] Start page with search, favorites, to-do, notes, weather, news.</li><li>[Boarisch] All local: data stays in your browser (localStorage).</li></ul><h5>[Boarisch] Shortcuts</h5><ul><li>[Boarisch] Ctrl/Cmd+K: open command palette</li><li>[Boarisch] 1-9: open first 9 favorites (when not typing)</li><li>[Boarisch] / : focus search (also via palette)</li><li>[Boarisch] Enter in search: start search</li><li>[Boarisch] ESC: close modals</li><li>[Boarisch] Palette: quick actions for widgets, theme, background, data, favorites</li><li>[Boarisch] Palette: key C switches card style, \"Reset header colors\" resets search & clock</li></ul><h5>[Boarisch] Search & Autocomplete</h5><ul><li>[Boarisch] Bangs: !g[Boarisch]  !ddg[Boarisch]  !bing[Boarisch]  !yt[Boarisch]  !wiki[Boarisch]  !maps</li><li>[Boarisch] Custom shortcuts: JSON in settings; {q}[Boarisch]  as placeholder</li><li>[Boarisch] Autocomplete: bangs, shortcuts, recent searches, wordlist (global + preset)</li><li>[Boarisch] Tab accepts suggestion, Enter starts search</li></ul><h5>[Boarisch] Tiles</h5><ul><li>[Boarisch] Drag & drop to sort, click to open</li><li>[Boarisch] + Tile: add a new favorite</li><li>[Boarisch] Reset: restore default favorites</li></ul><h5>[Boarisch] Widgets & Layout</h5><ul><li>[Boarisch] Visibility per widget</li><li>[Boarisch] Card style is global (glass, solid, transparent, soft minimal)</li><li>[Boarisch] Custom colors for clock/search; reset restores style defaults</li><li>[Boarisch] Widget colors & \"Tint widgets\" set the accent per card</li></ul><h5>[Boarisch] Background</h5><ul><li>[Boarisch] Presets, uploads, collections, rotation (time/theme/interval)</li><li>[Boarisch] Accent color is extracted from the active background</li></ul><h5>[Boarisch] Data</h5><ul><li>[Boarisch] Export/Import as JSON</li><li>[Boarisch] Load data presets (assets/presets/*.json in the repo)</li></ul></div></div>"
